      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4709b5c51c56414d47539d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是因为这样，大家才会追求更精彩的奇迹。\n而我也不想辜负他们的期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f40ca7284eae58b582859c2c64be16a9fb3065261c41b1bafb08beab8d74a398",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:667596c6bdebc772c0afa183",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后，外界对她的赞美持续了好一阵子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42dc87964ca77fa66de9ff0241eb8b1c837cbfc57391a205ccf13be177537d4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acad902b4d4e11f141c28f71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅如此，富士奇石经常逗人开心的\n言行举止、奇特的退场方式和戏剧张力的宣言\n也带来帮助，让她的人气急速攀升──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3454d3e0fce6eff8250adb4638fe0da98155df08617f7ea038fbd41ea21cc844",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:890458b0f66007f19b2fb3d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "许许多多的报导和精华剪辑影片，\n像是雨后春笋般不断问世。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a093d4bb336e7c350c8f4e65e599169eeb276084bfad777e61af3914899eb65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0771d11d40bc50d1a798f808",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众A",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee86b64dc7889c9a8a0c3464472500fce48b2487b81ae5e25e0e3845b56d9ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:160469023111efc447b96551",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你的表现太棒了！当我听说你的资质比较\n偏英里时，还担心不晓得会怎么样呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09110b5a395339ce999411edc138229e9e01a5024df44157313a4ad69b2c470d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d53553ac8f560ddf8a0e1678",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众A",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee86b64dc7889c9a8a0c3464472500fce48b2487b81ae5e25e0e3845b56d9ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a90a289ecee29d4370a14ac2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是！无论是输是赢，你都很了不起！\n你确实挺身面对了那堵高墙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a231cd6b3d27379b07dd4b70a0383b9bfd16d6e2863975af8178229e22feafa9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:281af704e22a5cba7607204d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众B",
      "source_fingerprint": "390e99b875309ce8dffa43c309cd672a1d06d9c90d7fc87508a784816fcbd999",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
