      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb10677f98f1648b413b1007",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从京都回来之后，\n富士奇石立刻到训练员室这么问我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90ecb229edd1798c042b2da40718b766caf2ee90eb6fad71cbd3f64bd4ced544",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8314922987d194b1af03afe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是没关系啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "46c2589fd80c99c8460468616d7c2d03e739c2d7a22d1963f904a8d6f4dc62a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34844a55566a53e7c82df4dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到“高松宫纪念”，\n那是一场草地1200米的短距离GⅠ竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c04e589fe9abf9939e4cc61e7f65ae1a586c5906ddb4b02270c621bffd5352",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6daaef1f2a4efdac8506c8aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我原本还在猜想，喜欢吓唬人的她，\n可能会说出更与众不同的提议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aefbce5c7bcf5cb617548319d8eed44655dd66ddd0d37edd9cbac19a582da775",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005313.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb20990a8ac2d1831f02610",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "富士奇石",
      "source_fingerprint": "630c9bd72789e662b81a8b83212e911d7bcbf6bb2d055023fb47ed14bb6bbee0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
