      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，现在我可以说──\n我想在古马级拿出更胜经典级的表演。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e290e9aca351a1a7c0231a3d39219497522f8729329a4989cba5f513f93275d9",
