      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“她在古马级的活跃也相当值得期待。\n虽然她尚未发表参赛计划──”",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd19e11d479027d27d17bdc5b7ea4050624f3f4f742a004df2b96a472c172d16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
