      "source_text": "“不过所有人都对她的未来\n抱持着深深期待”──呵呵，真让人有点害臊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e02410c28a0666c8987bd1b87bcf20d8100969d4f53cada23ff4057f464f372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
